WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.586
Listen up.
While we're all here,

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.922
there are some things
that we ought to figure out

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.507
before we rip this place apart.

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:11.970
I feel like I'm genuinely

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:14.598 line:0%
shocked with how fun
the cast is.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.267 line:0%
It's really fun.
Our downtime is great.

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:20.354 line:0%
It wasn't hard. We kind of
liked being around each other.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:22.064
-It's been really fun. Yeah.
-I've loved it.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.273
We've had a great time.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:25.108 line:0%
We have a lot of fun
in between rehearsals.

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.655
We all just get the giggles.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.365 line:0%
A lot.
Especially in group scenes.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:33.033
There was one scene
where Kathryn

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:34.785
had to do, like,
this big speech.

00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:36.870
Is there anyone who objects?

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:38.455
It was, like, quite serious.

00:00:38.539 --> 00:00:40.749
A bunch of girls behind me
just got the giggles

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:43.001 line:0%
-and it was pretty funny.
-We just can't stop laughing.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:44.211
You'll see us
in the background.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.380
We'll just be laughing
and they're just hilarious.

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:47.965
When it's a sensitive scene...

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.467
Somebody clear that table.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.511
...we all come together
and we huddle.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.389
And we just take a couple
deep breaths all together.

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:57.558
And then we all feel
kind of connected

00:00:57.641 --> 00:00:58.767
and in sync again.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.728 line:0%
We play probably about
three games of chess

00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:03.689
every night before
going to sleep.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:05.065
And I've become, like,
a chess master.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.693 line:0%
Jack Mulhern and I
started a book club.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.695 line:0%
A lot of other people
joke about it on set

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:11.613 line:0%
because we're always off
hovered in a corner

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:13.532
over this ancient Greek text.

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:14.992
The first week
before we started,

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.743
I had everyone over
and we made dinner.

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.453
Me and Alex,
who plays Harry,

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:19.955
have gone and rented
a house,

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.415 line:0%
and we've been having
quite a few parties.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:22.833
I never went to college,

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.668
so I thought I had missed
the chance

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.586 line:0%
for that experience.

00:01:25.669 --> 00:01:27.170 line:0%
But I definitely got it
on this show.

00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:29.423
It's been the coolest thing.
Everyone seems very grateful

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:30.799
for being on this production.

00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:33.302
It's just such a good...

00:01:33.677 --> 00:01:35.095
just good vibes all around.

